{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1120422001:0":{"text":"手紙を土に埋めた瞬間、お別れを告げられた気がして、かなり楽になったんです……","source_cn":"信埋进土里的瞬间，我感到了放松很多，像是完成了告别……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0BF92E9F86E29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120422002:0":{"text":"思い出した、ジャクソンさんが僕が羨ましいって言った理由を。","source_cn":"我想起来了，贾克松大哥之前为什么会说很羡慕我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A11724B67E6FB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120422003:0":{"text":"どうして？","source_cn":"为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E7417DCB53E6D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120422004:0":{"text":"あの時、僕たちは岩壁の後ろに隠れて砂嵐をやり過ごしていたんだ。彼から、このまま死んじゃうのかって聞かれたよ。","source_cn":"当时我们蜷缩在岩壁后面躲避沙暴，他问我，我们是不是要死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EFCEE4D920070A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120422005:0":{"text":"僕はこう言った、「いや！僕は死なない。僕が死んだらメリッサは泣くからな！」ってね。","source_cn":"我说：不！要是我死了，梅丽莎一定会哭出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F65CE4EBFC18FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120422006:0":{"text":"そして、彼は「涙を流せるのは幸せなことだ」って。","source_cn":"他说，能流泪，很幸福。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA4507105B1C69D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120422007:0":{"text":"「自分が死んで涙を流してくれる人がいることは、もっと幸せなことなんだ……」って言ってた。","source_cn":"有死后能为自己流泪的人，是更值得庆幸的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E49041464D2B6C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120422008:0":{"text":"ジャクソンさん……","source_cn":"贾克松大哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA3A8FC992581CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1120422008":{"text":"ジャクソンさん……","source_cn":"贾克松大哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA3A8FC992581CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120422009:0":{"text":"ぼ……僕が泣くわけないだろう！？僕たちはソヨゴ学会のツートップなんだ！山を越え砂漠を越え、禁じられた神の知識までも探究した！なのに……！","source_cn":"我……我怎么能哭？！我们，冬青学会的双星！跨越了群山和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66A03B8F37084107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120422010:0":{"text":"どうして、道すがらに何気なく出会った、友達とも